  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Airbus A330-243 Aircraft for Emirates Airlines Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at contributing to the expansion of Emirates Airlines
fleet by purchasing a new Airbus model A330_243.  The aircraft will be equipped with two Rolls Royce Trent 772B_60 Engines, together with maintenance and technical records in the English language.  It is a purchase and lease back operation under Sukuk.</narrative>
  </description>
